<title>USA: Trident Rowan year-end net loss increases.</title>
<headline>Trident Rowan year-end net loss increases.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr loss		   $2.14     loss	 $1.35</p>
<p> Net loss		   9,806     loss	 4,562</p>
<p> Net sales		 63,272		   47,224</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Full name of company is Trident Rowan Group Inc.</p>
<p>The above tabulated figures pertain to the company's year-end results for the period ending December 31 1996 and 1995.</p>
<p>A company spokesman said results for the quarter were not immediately available.</p>
</text>
